    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The Power enchantment "
        },
        {
          "text": "increases the amount of attack damage dealt to a player or mob when using your bow",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nWizards aligned with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Council of Wizards",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " see their "
        },
        {
          "text": "Embers and Projectiles gain homing capabilities, smites gain more damage from falling, and can place increased sigils",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " when any of these spells are cast from a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Wand, Staff, or Bangle",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " with this enchantment on it.\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "The increased sigils are only valid when placed using a staff with this enchant.  If another sigil is placed using a spell without the enchant, the sigils will again be clamped to the lower limit.",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
